    "updated_at": "2022-11-28T01:51:20Z",
    "body": "Your existing configuration is interfering with starship's ability to execute the appropriate commands to update its draw.\r\n\r\nIf I comment out the following line from your config:\r\n\r\n```\r\n[ \"$NEWLINE_BEFORE_PROMPT\" = yes ] && PROMPT_COMMAND=\"PROMPT_COMMAND=echo\"\r\n```\r\n\r\nthen I regain the ability to see directory changes in the prompt, although I'm not sure what else might be broken by the other configuration in this file.\r\n",
